title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"冒雪行车，迎风访道，投余特地参同。","body":{"start":1492,"hash":"b5a11f41f509527c81e81c1becfb9af401a81d9dc2fae335a807997817700f26"}},{"id":"yuan-era:1493","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"师如子产，我似嘉鱼。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1494","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"和公师叔，升霞之后。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1495","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"吾剑非凡，玉皇宣赐，非吾谁敢承当。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1496","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"见人错失，动我心肠。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1497","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"家缘猛弃，更不疑惑。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1498","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"山侗昔日，忒煞暮故。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1499","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"专违宁海，专游陕右。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1500","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"波波劫劫，劫劫波波。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1501","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"山侗昔日，名利忙忙。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1502","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"孤眠独处，不迷外境。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1503","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"幼则随群，长而异众，一心法箓行持。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1504","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"无涯火院，如牢如狱。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1505","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"心狂意乱，歌迷酒惑。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1506","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"昨宵梦见，遍地黄金。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1507","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"掣断名缰，敲开利锁，忻然跃出樊笼。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1508","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"妙行真人，重阳师父，遇师吕祖玄通。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1509","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"山侗昔日，火院中间，千斤重担常耽。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1510","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"昔年名利，役碎顽心。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1511","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"七宝庵中，三清门里，全真堂建相当。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1512","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"年小灵童，出家学道，师言侧耳须听。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1513","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"般般识破，物物难惑。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1514","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"人居浮世，身是浮生。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1515","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"人生七十，罕希寿数。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1516","title":"满庭芳","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"人喜生儿，谁知替你，被他夺了精神。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1517","title":"满庭芳 刀圭法","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"日月交宫，虎龙共处，不分南北东西。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1518","title":"满庭芳 不看谒","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"不谒公侯，不疏贫贱，不求富贵荣华。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1519","title":"满庭芳 劝化","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"人皆好色，妻常设计。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1520","title":"满庭芳 劝沃州孙仙进道","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"神仙何处，只在蓬莱。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1521","title":"满庭芳 劝道友","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"怜妻爱妾，忧儿愁女。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1522","title":"满庭芳 劝道友","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"堪嗟夫妇，错了良因。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1523","title":"满庭芳 化胡了仙兄弟四首 其一","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"三尸调引，六贼迷惑。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1524","title":"满庭芳 心自笑","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"学道修竹，累功积行，常愁行少功亏。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1525","title":"满庭芳 叹世","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"行尸走骨，逐利争名。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1526","title":"满庭芳 叹名利","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"利惹心猿，名牵意马，无昼无夜奔驰。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1527","title":"满庭芳 叹骷髅","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"携筇信步，郊外闲游。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1528","title":"满庭芳 叹憨汉","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"镜内苍颜，梳间白发，犹然骋俊刚求。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1529","title":"满庭芳 处自然","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"清净真功，无为大道，自然体用惺忪。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1530","title":"满庭芳 示同流","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"修行之士，莫要浮憢。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1531","title":"满庭芳 立门户内持","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"全真门户，清净根源。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1532","title":"满庭芳 立誓状外戒","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"专烧誓状，谨发盟言。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1533","title":"满庭芳 冰雪亭题晏子礼","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"瑞霭浮浮，祥氛冉冉，卷帘缟夜幽光。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1534","title":"满庭芳 因梦作","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"时当春社，庵里闲眠。","body":84},{"id":"yuan-era:1535","title":"满庭芳 师父画骷髅相诱引稍悟","author":"马钰","collection":"元","notice":"","excerpt":"风仙化我，无限词章。","body":84}]